    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="41">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 41</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif munuc oððe mæssepreost wiðersaca wurðe mid ealle, he sy amansumod æfre, buton he þe rædlicor gebuge to his þearfe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a monk or a priest becomes an utter apostate, he shall be excommunicated for ever, unless he is wise enough to return to his duty.</ab>
      </div>
